<Layout title="Services & Pricing" description="Website and Google Business Profile packages for South West UK businesses, fair fixed prices.">
  <h1>Services & <em>pricing</em></h1>
  <p class="lede">Fixed prices, no surprise extras.</p>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Package</th><th>Price</th><th>What it's for</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Website + Google Business Profile</td><td>£950–£1,500</td><td>The full fix — a proper site and a Google presence that works</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Website only</td><td>£750–£950</td><td>Your Google listing's already sorted, you just need the site</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Fix what you've got</td><td>Free audit, quoted after</td><td>Existing WordPress/Wix/Squarespace site or listing that needs work</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Ongoing care</td><td>~£30–£60/month</td><td>Send me changes, I make them — no waiting, no CMS to learn</td></tr>
  </table>
  <p>Social media and ads management: available once we're working together — ask me directly.</p>
  <a href="/contact/" class="btn">Book your free 15-minute audit</a>
</Layout>
